# SHA-256 fingerprint of the Google Play upload certificate
# (CN=Bisoncraft LLC, O=Bisoncraft LLC, C=US; RSA 4096; valid until 2056-11-17).
#
# The upload key signs the Android App Bundle sent to Play and nothing a user
# installs. release/package-android.sh fails a build whose bundle is signed by
# anything else, which catches the two keystores being swapped. If Google
# resets the upload key, this file changes with it.
84:B1:98:1E:EE:C1:2E:7C:66:BA:09:88:58:6D:C8:DB:A5:00:E7:41:B4:C3:AE:FF:29:AD:38:B7:6E:16:E8:BF
